{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102535","id":2322517972,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Kbs_U","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102535","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102535.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102535.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102535","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102535/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102535/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102535/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7f89294f1d15b1ad987334d70af97adcb87c2285","number":102535,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix Plugin Scripts load twice on startup","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Fixes #100750\r\n\r\nThanks to @HolonProduction for helping fix this issue.!!\r\n\r\nThe issue was caused by the plugin script being loaded twice on startup when the same script is used in the plugin's `ready` method and as an autoload. Autoloads are created before plugins, triggering the first load. When the plugin is enabled, the script is loaded again with `CACHE_MODE_IGNORE`, causing it to reload while `await` calls are still running.  \r\n\r\nI changed the cache mode to `CACHE_MODE_REUSE` when enabling plugins on editor startup (while the first scan is running).\r\n\r\nI tested this with the MRP from #100750, and as suggested by @HolonProduction, I also retested the MRP from **#70667**. Godot's startup process has changed quite a bit since this issue was first reported. Since #92667, scripts that reference resources can now load even before the first scan, allowing the project to load without any errors or warnings on the first startup without the `.godot` folder.  \r\n\r\nI have kept `CACHE_MODE_IGNORE` when the editor is not in startup mode to prevent potential side effects.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":307135532,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMDcxMzU1MzI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:plugin","name":"topic:plugin","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZW